## 1. Hermetic Testing Architecture

During automated execution, the application HTTP client is redirected to a local loopback listener running directly in the test process. Zero network packets escape to external servers:

<DiagramExpand title="HERMETIC NETWORK INTERCEPTION ARCHITECTURE">

```mermaid
graph LR
    subgraph AppCode ["MOBILE APP RUNTIME"]
        UI["UI View / ViewModel"] --> Client["HTTP Engine<br/>Retrofit &bull; URLSession &bull; Axios"]
    end

    subgraph InterceptionBoundary ["HERMETIC TEST BOUNDARY"]
        Client --> Interceptor{"Target URL Config"}
        Interceptor -->|Debug / Prod| Cloud["External API Gateway<br/>https://api.enterprise.com<br/>(BLOCKED IN CI)"]
        Interceptor -->|Test Execution| Loopback["Local Loopback Listener<br/>http://localhost:8080"]
    end

    subgraph MockEngine ["MOCK DISPATCH ENGINE"]
        Loopback --> Dispatcher["Dynamic Path Dispatcher"]
