## 3. Step 1: Create the Request File (`saucelabs.request.yml`)

Create a file named `saucelabs.request.yml` in the root directory of your repository. This file identifies your application in Sauce Labs storage:

```yaml
app_name: my-mobile-app
platform: android # Allowed: android or ios
owner_email: mobile-engineering@enterprise.internal
team: mobile-platform
description: Enterprise mobile application provisioned via Bitrise CI/CD

# Optional Metadata Fields
business_unit: corporate
environment: staging
repository: https://git.enterprise.internal/mobile-engineering/my-mobile-app.git
```

