## 4. Step 2: Configure the Test Runner (`.sauce/config.yml`)

Sauce Labs uses the declarative `saucectl` CLI to orchestrate test execution across real device pools.

Create a folder named `.sauce/` in your repository root, and place a `config.yml` file inside it:

<Tabs>
  <TabItem label="Android (Espresso)">
    **`.sauce/config.yml` (Android Espresso)**
    ```yaml
    apiVersion: v1alpha
    kind: espresso
    sauce:
      region: us-west-1
      concurrency: 2
      metadata:
        build: "Bitrise Build $BITRISE_BUILD_NUMBER"
        tags:
          - "staging"
          - "espresso"

    espresso:
      app: storage:$SAUCE_APP_ID
      testApp: storage:$SAUCE_TEST_APP_ID

    suites:
      - name: "Pixel-Real-Device-Espresso"
        devices:
          - name: "Google Pixel.*"
            platformVersion: "14"
        testOptions:
          class:
            - "com.enterprise.mobile.ui.OrderCheckoutEspressoTest"

      - name: "Samsung-Galaxy-Espresso"
        devices:
          - name: "Samsung Galaxy S.*"
            platformVersion: "13"
    ```
  </TabItem>

  <TabItem label="iOS (XCUITest)">
    **`.sauce/config.yml` (iOS XCUITest)**
    ```yaml
    apiVersion: v1alpha
    kind: xcuitest
    sauce:
      region: us-west-1
      concurrency: 2
      metadata:
        build: "Bitrise Build $BITRISE_BUILD_NUMBER"
        tags:
          - "staging"
          - "xcuitest"

    xcuitest:
      app: storage:$SAUCE_APP_ID
      testApp: storage:$SAUCE_TEST_APP_ID

    suites:
      - name: "iPhone-Real-Device-XCUITest"
        devices:
          - name: "iPhone (15|16).*"
            platformVersion: "18"
        testOptions:
          class:
            - "OrderCheckoutXCUITest"
    ```
  </TabItem>

  <TabItem label="Cross-Platform (Maestro)">
    **`.sauce/config.yml` (Maestro YAML Flows)**
    ```yaml
    apiVersion: v1alpha
    kind: maestro
    sauce:
      region: us-west-1
      concurrency: 2
      metadata:
        build: "Bitrise Build $BITRISE_BUILD_NUMBER"
        tags:
          - "staging"
          - "maestro"

    maestro:
      app: storage:$SAUCE_APP_ID
      flows:
        - ".maestro/flows/02-offline-order-sync.yaml"

    suites:
      - name: "Real-Device-Maestro-Android"
        devices:
          - name: "Google Pixel.*"
            platformVersion: "14"
      - name: "Real-Device-Maestro-iOS"
        devices:
          - name: "iPhone 16.*"
            platformVersion: "18"
    ```
  </TabItem>
</Tabs>

